  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 8.0.0-Beta-2 - 2026-02-18\n\n- Added following Enums \"OnboardingType\" , \"PayoutTimeType\" , \"UserAction\"\n- Added Folder \"Errors\", Added new class SystemInfoError for systemInfo related.\n- Moved AccessRightAttribute & LogMethodExecutionAttribute from Core.Clean.Api to Core.Clean.Common\n- Added IMerchantDetailService in Integrations->Database->Abstractions\n- Added the following models MerchantCommunication, MerchantDetails, MerchantSettingsCommunication & MerchantSettingsDetails\n- Added ExpressionBuilder\n- Added PaginationRequest & PaginationResponse\n- Updated ApiIdentity TimeZone property name \"TimeZone\" => \"TimeZoneInfo\"\n- Enhanced IQueryableRepository abstraction to support dynamic and paginated queries. \n- Added following Aws Messages \"BaseMerchantMessage\" , \"MerchantActivatedMessage\" , \"MerchantCreatedMessage\" , \"MerchantDeactivatedMessage\" , \"MerchantDeletedMessage\" , \"MerchantModifiedMessage\" & \"TimeZoneModifiedMessage\"\n- Added following Aws Events \"MerchantActivated\" , \"MerchantCreated\" , \"MerchantDeactivated\" , \"MerchantDeleted\" , \"MerchantModified\" , \"TimeZoneModified\"\n- Enhanced StringExtensions to support dynamic filtering and query parsing.\n- Added SystemInfoError",
